# Workflow

## Step 1 — Developer Writes Code
Developer uses VS Code Copilot normally.

---

## Step 2 — Agent Detects Change
The orchestrator automatically detects:
- File changes
- New commits
- Pull requests

---

## Step 3 — Sonar Analysis Starts
The system automatically runs:
- Static code analysis
- Vulnerability checks
- Code smell detection
- Coverage validation

---

## Step 4 — Quality Gate Validation
The system checks:
- Security rating
- Maintainability
- Reliability
- Duplication
- Test coverage

---

## Step 5 — Autonomous Fix Loop
If issues are found:
- Agent attempts fixes automatically
- Generates corrected code
- Re-runs validation

---

## Step 6 — QA Validation
QA Agent:
- Generates tests
- Validates fixes
- Ensures regression safety

---

## Step 7 — Audit & Evidence Storage
All actions are logged:
- Scan results
- Fix history
- Validation decisions
- Merge approvals

